---
title: How to add emoji and format messages in discussions
sidebar:
  order: 5
---
#### **Adding Emoji:**

1. **Access the Discussion Panel:**
   - Navigate to the “Discussion” tab to find your desired conversation.
1. **Open the Emoji Picker:**
   - Click on the smiley face icon in the message input area to open the emoji panel.
1. **Choose Your Emoji:**
   - Browse through various emojis and select the one you wish to add to your message.
1. **Send the Message:**
   - Once you’ve added your emoji, type your message and click the “Send” button.

![](./how-to-add-emoji-and-format-messages-in-discussions/content/image-205.png)

#### **Formatting a Message:**

1. **Highlight Text to Format:**
   - While typing your message in the input box, select the text you wish to format.
1. **Open the Formatting Toolbar:**
   - A toolbar will appear with multiple formatting options like **Bold (B)**, *Italics (I)*, *Underline (U)*, and more.
1. **Apply Desired Formatting:**
   - Choose the formatting style by clicking the respective option on the toolbar.
1. **Send the Message:**
   - After formatting, press “Send” to post your styled message.

![](./how-to-add-emoji-and-format-messages-in-discussions/content/image-206.png)
